  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Brian Powers</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5735 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-news tag-brian-powers tag-chatham-bars-inn tag-david-schofield tag-karen-marshall-shortsleeve tag-sedona-summer\" id=\"post-5735\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-members-exhibit-at-chatham-bars-inn/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"663\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a beach with waves and sand.\" src=\"/media/archive/285d9ed6e64f7d4f5fd8f7c1c6c3e4e96c99d217a828deb0f00df7ab9be8319f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-members-exhibit-at-chatham-bars-inn/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Members Exhibit at Chatham Bars Inn</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-24T18:44:52-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, March 24, 2021, 6:44 pm\">March 24, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists was recently featured at the Chatham Bars Inn ‘Meet the Artist’ Winter Art Series on Saturday, March 20, 2021. Paintings by seventeen Guild members were <a href=\"/news/guild-members-exhibit-at-chatham-bars-inn/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5716 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-brian-powers tag-chatham-bars-inn\" id=\"post-5716\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/chatham-bars-inn-winter-meet-the-artists-art-series/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"187\" height=\"249\" alt=\"A painting of a sailboat on the water.\" src=\"/media/archive/eff3acc6c64e4afa0d27a197156c4114c7bba26290f0ecd7c8f93bd611000b28.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/chatham-bars-inn-winter-meet-the-artists-art-series/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Chatham Bars Inn Winter ‘Meet the Artists’ Art Series</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-13T09:01:25-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, March 13, 2021, 9:01 am\">March 13, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Chatham Bars Inn Winter ‘Meet the Artists’ Art Series will host the Guild of Harwich Artists on Saturday, March 20, from 1:00 – 5:00 p.m. The lobby exhibition will feature <a href=\"/news/chatham-bars-inn-winter-meet-the-artists-art-series/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4037 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-brian-powers tag-cape-cod-art-center tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-martha-little-fuentes\" id=\"post-4037\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"All new england 2018 exhibit flyer.\" src=\"/media/archive/90629c140aa39b3390f0386483f0b1bbf3caa77e12db9541b5b9aa4095ea6b4d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header